---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BookOpen, ArrowRight, ShieldCheck, ExternalLink } from 'lucide-react';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Academic Resources | Society of Applied Mathematics of UPLB"
  description="Public academic resources and official resource updates from the Society of Applied Mathematics of UPLB."
>
  <section class="py-20 sm:py-24 border-b border-[var(--border)] relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="glow-blob w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(240,204,78,0.12)_0%,transparent_70%)] top-0 left-[-10%]" aria-hidden="true" />

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[var(--foreground)] tracking-tight">
          Academic <span class="text-gold-gradient">Resources</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--primary)]/90">
          VERIFIED PUBLIC MATERIALS
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed font-normal">
          SAM-UP's public resource directory is being rebuilt around source-backed materials. Detailed course coverage, tutorial syllabi, and downloadable files appear here only after the material itself and its public visibility are verified.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 space-y-12">
    <section class="frosted-glass-card p-8 sm:p-10" aria-labelledby="resource-verification-heading">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--primary)]">
          <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true" />
          <span>RESOURCE REVIEW</span>
        </div>
        <h2 id="resource-verification-heading" class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[var(--foreground)]">
          Unsupported syllabus details have been removed.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          The previous page expanded a short program description into specific course topics and an additional course without an approved public source. The redesign will publish only real, approved reviewers, tutorial materials, schedules, or external links with clear source and update metadata.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" aria-label="Resource publishing criteria">
      <article class="frosted-glass-card p-6">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--primary)]">01 / SOURCE</div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-bold text-xl text-[var(--foreground)]">Approved material</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          A public resource needs an identifiable source file, page, or official external destination.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="frosted-glass-card p-6">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--primary)]">02 / VISIBILITY</div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-bold text-xl text-[var(--foreground)]">Public-safe access</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          Internal academic databases, member-only files, and unapproved materials are not exposed by default.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="frosted-glass-card p-6">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--primary)]">03 / FRESHNESS</div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-bold text-xl text-[var(--foreground)]">Clear update state</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          Time-sensitive schedules and course coverage are labeled with their current source instead of being inferred from old records.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="frosted-glass-card p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--primary)]">
          <BookOpen class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true" />
          <span>CURRENT INFORMATION</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[var(--foreground)]">
          Looking for a current tutorial or academic announcement?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] max-w-xl">
          Check the Programs page and SAM-UP's latest official public announcement while the resource catalog is being verified.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 shrink-0">
        <a
          href="/events"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--primary)] text-[var(--primary-foreground)] font-bold text-sm hover:bg-[var(--primary-hover)] transition-all shadow-md shadow-[var(--primary)]/20"
        >
          <span>Programs & Updates</span>
          <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://facebook.com/SAMUPLB"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface-raised)] border border-[var(--border)] text-[var(--foreground)] font-semibold text-sm hover:border-[var(--border-primary)] transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>Official SAM-UP page</span>
          <ExternalLink class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
